msgstr "theta=40.893 处的第二种七连菱形布局：一种不同的 rep-7 七连菱形分形爬行体（Fathauer, Bridges 2026）"

#: fractal_reptile_generator.py:1105
msgid "A second tetrakite layout (theta=0): a distinct rep-4 kite fractal reptile (Fathauer, Bridges 2026)"
msgstr "第二种四连筝形布局（theta=0）：一种不同的 rep-4 筝形分形爬行体（Fathauer, Bridges 2026）"

#: fractal_reptile_generator.py:1099
msgid "A second trikite layout (theta=-30): a distinct rep-3 kite fractal reptile (Fathauer, Bridges 2026)"
msgstr "第二种三连筝形布局（theta=-30）：一种不同的 rep-3 筝形分形爬行体（Fathauer, Bridges 2026）"

#: fabrication_slicer.py:975
msgid "A separate DXF for each sheet, using plain CUT and ENGRAVE layer names. Use this for software that copes badly with many layers in one drawing"
msgstr "每张板片单独导出 DXF，使用简单的 CUT 和 ENGRAVE 图层名。适用于难以处理单个图纸中大量图层的软件"

#: modular_screen_generator.py:392
msgid "A shallow woven undulation, cos x + cos y"
msgstr "浅平的编织起伏，cos x + cos y"

#: fabrication_slicer.py:971
msgid "A single DXF holding every sheet, each on its own layers (S01_CUT, S02_CUT ...) and all at a common origin, so a sheet can be isolated and cut on its own"
msgstr "单个 DXF 包含所有板片，各自位于自己的图层（S01_CUT、S02_CUT……）且均以同一原点对齐，从而可以单独隔离并切割某张板片"

#: gem_generator.py:307
msgid "A single Principled BSDF at the sodium-D index: cheap and EEVEE-friendly, but with no fire"
msgstr "单个使用钠 D 线折射率的原理化 BSDF：开销低且适合 EEVEE，但没有火彩"

#: orbital_generator.py:259
msgid "A single atomic orbital or a molecular combination"
msgstr "单个原子轨道或分子组合"

#: apollonian_generator.py:118
msgid "A single color"
msgstr "单一颜色"

#: saddle_polyhedron_generator.py:762
msgid "A single colour"
msgstr "单一颜色"

#: aperiodic_generator.py:1614
#: celtic_knot_2d_generator.py:2446
msgid "A single material"
msgstr "单一材质"

#: saddle_polyhedron_generator.py:662
msgid "A single saddle polyhedron"
msgstr "单个鞍形多面体"

#: symmetric_sculpture_generator.py:3119
msgid "A small stellated dodecahedron {5/2, 5}: 12 five-armed stars in the dodecahedral planes, traced from the cutting template. The arms end on the crossings at twice the plane distance, where five planes meet, so each of the solid's 12 spikes is built from five arms"
msgstr "小星形十二面体 {5/2, 5}：十二面体平面内的 12 个五臂星，按切割模板描出。臂终止于两倍平面距离处的交点，那里五个平面相交，因此该立体的 12 个尖角各由五条臂构成"

#: relief_solid_generator.py:179
msgid "A solved vibration mode of the torus itself"
msgstr "环面自身的一个求解振型"

#: leaf_generator.py:148
msgid "A source is consumed once a vein reaches this close. It is the control that sets how fine the network is, because it is what stops veins crowding"
msgstr "当叶脉接近到此距离时源点即被消耗。该参数决定网络的精细程度，因为它正是阻止叶脉拥挤的控制项"

#: interlocking_generator.py:497
msgid "A space-filling 11-hedron (Inchbald 1996): 7 quads + 4 triangles, grown into an interlocking cluster by its face-adjacency motions (four cells make a translation 'boat'); guaranteed non-overlapping"
msgstr "一种空间填满的 11 面体（Inchbald 1996）：7 个四边形 + 4 个三角形，通过其面邻接运动生长为互锁簇（四个单元构成一个平移「船」）；保证不重叠"

#: helical_surface_generator.py:572
#: minimal_surface_toolkit.py:629
msgid "A sparse openwork net of struts along the cells of the surface's dual, as a live modifier stack"
msgstr "沿曲面对偶单元分布的稀疏镂空杆件网，以实时修改器堆栈形式呈现"

#: topological_surface_generator.py:536
msgid "A sphere carrying three cross-caps: the connected sum of three projective planes -- the same surface, by von Dyck's theorem"
msgstr "带三个交叉帽的球面：三个射影平面的连通和——由 von Dyck 定理，二者是同一曲面"

#: relief_solid_generator.py:745
msgid "A sphere has no flat structure for a repeating pattern%s"
msgstr "球面没有可供重复图案使用的平坦结构%s"

#: relief_solid_generator.py:157
msgid "A spherical harmonic -- the sphere's own vibration mode"
msgstr "球谐函数——球面自身的振型"

#: interlocking_generator.py:445
msgid "A square domain edge-deformed, turned 90 deg at mid-height and lofted back; sine gives Estrin's osteomorphic saddle block, tent a Versatile-style block; every layer tiles so copies interlock"
msgstr "正方形域经边缘变形、在中间高度旋转 90 度再放样回去；正弦给出 Estrin 的骨形态鞍块，帐篷形给出 Versatile 式块；每层都可平铺，使复制体互锁"

#: knot_carpet_generator.py:4737
msgid "A square grid of strands pushed through a smooth swirl displacement"
msgstr "方形网格股线经过平滑漩涡位移"

#: zonohedra_generator.py:456
msgid "A square middle level when n is even, and the limiting profile of a sinusoid of slope 1 at the poles"
msgstr "n 为偶数时为方形中间层，在两极为斜率 1 的正弦曲线的极限剖面"

#: helical_surface_generator.py:638
msgid "A straight generatrix, which makes the result a ruled surface"
msgstr "直线母线，使结果为直纹曲面"

#: canal_surface_generator.py:81
msgid "A straight spine. Constant radius gives the exact cylinder (capsule with end caps); a linear taper gives a cone of spheres"
msgstr "直线脊线。等半径给出精确圆柱（带端盖的胶囊体）；线性锥化给出球锥"

#: helical_surface_generator.py:523
msgid "A torus whose tube breathes: z = b sin(v) cos(k u). Integer k gives a torus, half-odd-integer k a Klein bottle, and k = 1/2 with equal radii a cross-cap"
msgstr "管径呼吸的环面：z = b sin(v) cos(k u)。整数 k 给出环面，半奇数 k 给出克莱因瓶，k = 1/2 且半径相等时给出交叉帽"

#: topological_surface_generator.py:532
msgid "A torus with one disk cut away and the rim of the hole glued to itself antipodally: the connected sum of a torus and a projective plane"
msgstr "挖去一个圆盘并将孔缘对径粘合的环面：环面与射影平面的连通和"

#: circle_packing_generator.py:356
msgid "A triangulated rectangular grid"
msgstr "三角化的矩形网格"

#: relief_solid_generator.py:238
msgid "A triply periodic wave, for bases with no mode family"
msgstr "三重周期波，用于没有振型族的基底"

#: toroidal_polyhedron_generator.py:696
msgid "A uniform plane tiling wrapped onto the torus"
msgstr "缠绕到环面上的均匀平面平铺"

#: polytope4d_generator.py:437
msgid "A vertex-transitive polytope from Wythoff's kaleidoscope: the truncations, rectifications and expansions of the regular ones, and the 4-dimensional analogues of the Archimedean solids"
msgstr "由 Wythoff 万花筒生成的顶点传递多胞体：正多胞体的截角、截半与展开，以及阿基米德立体的四维类比"

#: ifs_generator.py:158
msgid "A watertight slab one cell thick, meshed at plane resolution"
msgstr "一个单元厚的水密板，按平面分辨率划分网格"

#: kleinian_generator.py:236
msgid "A wild fractal Jordan curve"
msgstr "一条野性的分形若尔当曲线"

#: relief_solid_generator.py:164
msgid "A wind-driven sea wrapped round a torus"
msgstr "缠绕在环面上的风生海面"

#: spidron_rosette_generator.py:112
msgid "A wreath: one arm on each edge of a regular polygon, spiralling outward round an open centre"
msgstr "花环：正多边形每条边上一条臂，绕空心中心向外螺旋"

