#: symmetric_sculpture_generator.py:3141
msgid "After Dragonflies (2008): 12 six-armed parts in the face planes of the rhombic dodecahedron, the only octahedral preset here. Each is a subset of the face of the RD's THIRD stellation, so unlike the others its tips do not meet their neighbours -- Hart chose the subset so the part misses the other eleven. They sit instead on the stellation diagram's level-3 vertices, at three times the plane distance"
msgstr "仿 Dragonflies（2008）：12 个六臂部件，位于菱形十二面体的面平面中，是此处唯一的八面体预设。每个都是 RD 第三星形化面的子集，因此与其他不同，其端点不与相邻部件相接——Hart 选择该子集，使该部件避开另外十一个。它们改为位于星形化图的第 3 层顶点上，平面距离为三倍"

#: symmetric_sculpture_generator.py:3151
msgid "After Eddy (2018): 60 arched parts, two to each of the 30 rhombic-triacontahedral planes. The family is fixed by Hart's own bevel -- he cut the mating edges at 18 degrees, and this family's dihedrals of 36 and 144 give exactly that. The placement within the plane is still approximate: the tips sit on a 3-part and a 5-part meeting point at 1/phi^2 and 1/phi, points outward, but it finds five mating edges where Hart cut four"
msgstr "仿 Eddy（2018）：60 个拱形部件，30 个菱形三十面体平面各两个。该族由 Hart 自己的斜切确定——他将配合边切至 18 度，而该族的 36 度和 144 度二面角正好给出这一角度。平面内的放置仍为近似：端点位于 1/phi^2 和 1/phi 处的 3 部件与 5 部件交汇点，朝外，但它找到五条配合边，而 Hart 切了四条"

#: symmetric_sculpture_generator.py:3112
msgid "After Frabjous (2003): 30 S-shaped parts in the face planes of the GREAT rhombic triacontahedron -- ends meeting in threes at the 3-fold corners (phi^2 x the plane distance), five-fold vortices at the 5-fold corners (phi x)"
msgstr "仿 Frabjous（2003）：30 个 S 形部件，位于大菱形三十面体的面平面中——端部在三重角处以三个相接（平面距离 × phi^2），五重角处形成五重涡旋（× phi）"

#: symmetric_sculpture_generator.py:3134
msgid "After Solar Flair (2007): 60 pierced arms in the face planes of the pentagonal hexecontahedron, each running from one of the twelve 5-fold vertices to one of the twenty 3-fold ones. Traced from the cutting template, with both tips pinned on their symmetry axes"
msgstr "仿 Solar Flair（2007）：60 个带孔臂，位于五角六十面体的面平面中，每个从十二个五重顶点之一延伸到二十个三重顶点之一。按切割模板描摹，两端均固定在其对称轴上"

#: symmetric_sculpture_generator.py:3126
msgid "After Whimsy (2014): 60 flat blades in the face planes of the pentagonal hexecontahedron (snub dodecahedron dual). The blade is traced from the cutting template -- a curved band with two teardrop openings, tipped so five meet at each 5-fold hub and three at each 3-fold corner"
msgstr "仿 Whimsy（2014）：60 个扁平叶片，位于五角六十面体（扭棱十二面体对偶）的面平面中。叶片按切割模板描摹——一条带两个泪滴形开口的弯曲带，倾斜排列，使每个五重枢纽处五个相接，每个三重角处三个相接"

