#: constant_width_generator.py:270
msgid "Mark the solid's fold curves sharp (and creased). A Reuleaux rotation or Meissner body carries the sharp edges of the polygon it came from. The surface is smooth everywhere else, so shading straight across the fold rounds off the one feature that defines the shape"
msgstr "将立体的折痕曲线标记为锐边（并加折痕）。Reuleaux 旋转体或 Meissner 立体继承其来源多边形的锐边。曲面其余部分光滑，因此跨折痕直接平滑着色会磨掉定义该形状的唯一特征"

#: sphericon_generator.py:243
msgid "Mark the solid's fold curves sharp (and creased). A sphericon is two half-cones turned against each other; the rims where they meet are real edges. The surface is smooth everywhere else, so shading straight across the fold rounds off the one feature that defines the shape"
msgstr "将立体的折痕曲线标记为锐边（并加折痕）。Sphericon 是两个相对旋转的半锥体；它们相接的边缘是真实的边。曲面其余部分光滑，因此跨折痕直接平滑着色会磨掉定义该形状的唯一特征"

#: monostatic_body_generator.py:410
msgid "Mark the solid's fold curves sharp (and creased). The Gomboc and its relatives carry a ridge where the two monostatic lobes meet. The surface is smooth everywhere else, so shading straight across the fold rounds off the one feature that defines the shape"
msgstr "将立体的折痕曲线标记为锐边（并加折痕）。Gomboc 及其同类在单稳双瓣相接处带有一条脊线。曲面其余部分光滑，因此跨折痕直接平滑着色会磨掉定义该形状的唯一特征"

#: steinmetz_generator.py:547
msgid "Mark the solid's fold curves sharp (and creased). Two cylinders meet along a pair of planar ellipse-like edges; three meet along twelve. The surface is smooth everywhere else, so shading straight across the fold rounds off the one feature that defines the shape"
msgstr "将实体的折痕曲线标记为锐边（并设置折痕）。两个圆柱沿一对平面椭圆状边缘相接；三个圆柱沿十二条边缘相接。表面其他位置平滑，因此直接跨折痕进行平滑着色会磨圆定义该形状的唯一特征"

#: oloid_generator.py:139
msgid "Mark the two circular arcs sharp (and creased). The oloid and the two-circle roller are convex hulls, so the developable band folds back on itself along each circle -- those arcs are real edges and shading smooth across them rounds the whole form off. The ruled strips have no such fold and are left alone"
msgstr "将两段圆弧标记为锐边（并设置折痕）。Oloid 和双圆滚子都是凸包，因此可展带沿每个圆折回自身——这些弧是真实边缘，跨它们平滑着色会把整个形体磨圆。直纹条带没有这种折痕，保持不动"

